				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1532,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Wind): Add .gitignore for build artifacts and IDE files\n\nThis commit adds a new .gitignore file to the Wind Element to prevent ephemeral build artifacts and development configuration from being committed to the repository.\n\nChanges include:\n- Target build outputs (excluding debug/release folders)\n- Configuration bundles (TypeScript/ESBuild outputs)\n- Node.js dependencies (.node_modules)\n- Environment files (.env, .env.local)\n- Log files (*.log)\n- IDE configuration (.vscode/, .idea/)\n\nThis aligns with standard project hygiene practices, ensuring that build artifacts and local developer settings are excluded while maintaining the necessary folder structure in the repository.",
			"SHA": "cce2939c3acfa996d80e7e8fe9d601a5978f0d4d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-03-13T03:40:16Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1531,
				300
			],
			"Message": "build(Wind): Regenerate development build artifacts with source maps\n\nThis commit reverses the production build from the previous commit, regenerating the Wind Element's build artifacts in development mode. The key changes:\n\n- **Configuration/ESBuild**: All configuration files in `Configuration/ESBuild/` and `Target/Configuration/ESBuild/` have been regenerated from minified to readable format with proper variable names and formatting.\n- **Source Maps**: Added `.js.map` files for all Configuration/ESBuild modules to enable debugging.\n- **Target Artifacts**: Regenerated all target build outputs in `Target/` directory with full source maps.\n- **Documentation**: Added comprehensive 50-level analysis documentation block to `Source/Preload.ts`.\n\nThis aligns with the development workflow, switching from the production build (commit 40c5ac0) to enable debugging and development. The build now includes readable code and source maps for both the Configuration bundles and Target application artifacts.",
			"SHA": "0c4940d952103dd29d2f0476b024a76fe47a2e69"
		}
	],
